      "sourceTextSha256": "4048b1e6aa6449c270036882daf3434a6cedf90f73af06faafdf90b5d02e7958",
      "text": "Transfer to Angra dos Reis and a boat tour of the best beaches and islands of Angra.\n\nYou will have a boat trip to the islands and have some stops  on the best beaches and islands. You will enjoy  spectacular landscapes: white sands and  blue calm water of the sea,  many picturesque islets scattered around the bay. A journey out into the ocean may provide a chance to see dolphins, sea turtles, stingrays and sometimes even whales, and you can take a swim in the crystal clear waters.\n\nAngra is a dream destination with lots of islands just off the coast and beaches. We can enjoy lunch on one of the islands (not included)\n\nAfter our tropical adventure we take the bus further to Paraty. ",
